>> Animal := Ima musuq.
Animal patapi: ['sound:'] ruway: { :s ñuqap sound := s. }.
Animal patapi: ['makeSound'] ruway: { Lluqsiy qillqay: ñuqap sound. }.
>> Cat := Animal musuq.
Cat patapi: ['init'] ruway: { ñuqap sound := ['MEOW!'].}.
Cat patapi: ['meow'] ruway: { kikin makeSound. }.
Cat init.
Cat meow.
